###

### 7. REQUEST DELIVERY EXTENSION
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{urlPath}}/order/extension/{{orderId}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalDate": "2026-10-13",
  "newDate": "2026-10-16",
  "days": 3,
  "reason": "Additional development time is required.",
  "deliveryDateUpdate": "2026-10-05"
}

###

### 8. APPROVE DELIVERY DATE EXTENSION
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{urlPath}}/order/gig/approve/{{orderId}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalDate": "2026-10-13",
  "newDate": "2026-10-16",
  "days": 3,
  "reason": "Extension approved.",
  "deliveryDateUpdate": "2026-10-05"
}

###

### 9. REJECT DELIVERY DATE EXTENSION
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{urlPath}}/order/gig/reject/{{orderId}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalDate": "2026-10-13",
  "newDate": "2026-10-16",
  "days": 3,
  "reason": "Extension rejected.",
  "deliveryDateUpdate": "2026-10-05"
}

###

### 10. DELIVER ORDER - WITHOUT FILE
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{urlPath}}/order/deliver-order/{{orderId}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "The requested work has been completed.",
  "file": "",
  "fileType": "",
  "fileName": "",
  "fileSize": ""
}

###

### 11. APPROVE ORDER
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{urlPath}}/order/approve-order/{{orderId}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sellerId": "{{sellerId}}",
  "buyerId": "{{buyerId}}",
  "ongoingJobs": 0,
  "completedJobs": 1,
  "totalEarnings": 50,
  "purchasedGigs": 1
}

###

### 12. CANCEL ORDER
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{urlPath}}/order/cancel/{{orderId}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentIntentId": "{{paymentIntentId}}",
  "orderData": {
    "sellerId": "{{sellerId}}",
    "buyerId": "{{buyerId}}",
    "purchasedGigs": 0
  }
}

###

### 13. MARK NOTIFICATION AS READ
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{urlPath}}/order/notification/mark-as-read
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notificationId": "{{notificationId}}"
}